        <mxCell id="c28" value="&lt;i&gt;The model answer holds 19 pages: the nine visible pages of the tutorials, the four hidden detail pages (Tutorial 15.1 adds two, Tutorial 15.2 one and Exercise 15.1 one), a page for each of Ex 15.2 to Ex 15.6 and Notes. Its DAX query view tabs are Tests, Ex 15.1 and Checks. Tutorial 15.3 hides the three detail pages of the tutorials.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="487" width="860" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
